{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The hook</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hand-me-downs is a roguelike deck builder where your opponents use your own cards against you, so you need to carefully consider what to play each round.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your opponents don't have their own deck, so they borrow your cards!  <br>Each time you play a hand, your opponent takes the cards from your hand and uses them against you the next time you meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/e54f669445878884ac0ea283977b61da.poster.avif?t=1767881585\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/e54f669445878884ac0ea283977b61da.webm?t=1767881585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/e54f669445878884ac0ea283977b61da.mp4?t=1767881585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The vibes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Immerse yourself in this little slice of Adriatic culture as the gorgeous pixelated versions of the Triestine cards trigger to the beat of traditional Mediterranean music.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Played cards go to the battlefield, rhythmically triggering in order of their priority. The same set of cards can yield vastly different scores under different priority rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/87356cfbcf9320b11b0d9fa5c68b5976.poster.avif?t=1767881585\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/87356cfbcf9320b11b0d9fa5c68b5976.webm?t=1767881585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/87356cfbcf9320b11b0d9fa5c68b5976.mp4?t=1767881585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The spice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Lady luck may be your ally or your foe, but nothing she might throw at you can stifle a true master of strategy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The suit priority has the most influence on overall card priority.  <br>It's randomized each round to keep things fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/9f1ff701e4c0001080db1a93d68fe343.avif?t=1767881585\" width=1560 height=485 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The charm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Each</strong> <strong>suit has its own flavor, and each rank its unique character.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Triestine cards may not be familiar to many, but they certainly don't lack in personality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Throughout the game you'll get familiar with the\u00a0no-nonsense <strong><i>Bastoni</i></strong>, the fortunate <strong><i>Denari</i></strong>, the\u00a0jolly <strong><i>Coppe</i></strong> and the ruthless <strong><i>Spade</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The counterpart to the more familiar <strong>Jack</strong>, <strong>Queen</strong>, and <strong>King</strong> are respectively the <strong><i>Fante</i></strong>, <strong><i>Caval</i></strong>, and\u00a0<strong><i>Re.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Figuring out the numbered ranks and the aces is left as an exercise to the reader.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/38f48e3b3a9230f6d9dba43baaa61e9b.avif?t=1767881585\" width=1376 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Each opponent brings a unique twist to the table, so be careful which cards you let them have.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Most opponents you encounter are too prideful to simply use the cards you hand down to them without applying their own touch first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether it's the <strong>The Painter</strong>\u00a0changing the suits, or<strong> The General</strong>\u00a0ranking the cards up, your opponents will make sure to complicate your plans, and provide deck-fixing opportunities to those skillful enough to manipulate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After all, their cards are<i> <strong>your</strong></i>\u00a0cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/9a8cee2687e895163b95ef64fa8dbb52.poster.avif?t=1767881585\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/9a8cee2687e895163b95ef64fa8dbb52.webm?t=1767881585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/9a8cee2687e895163b95ef64fa8dbb52.mp4?t=1767881585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The plea</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>So sit back, relax, take in the sounds of our coast, decimate your opponents, and please don't tell our grandpas how we massacred their game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/af815c6f9affe4630bf6856c2cef4197.poster.avif?t=1767881585\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/af815c6f9affe4630bf6856c2cef4197.webm?t=1767881585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/af815c6f9affe4630bf6856c2cef4197.mp4?t=1767881585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870620?t=1767881585","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/4a37b1d1f507a511811dc7cb8a17f5fb4d01b254/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767881585","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.st